        "subject": "LU-20992 tests: skip sanity-pfl/28 for old MDS",
        "message": "LU-20992 tests: skip sanity-pfl/28 for old MDS\n\nsanity-pfl test_28 fails in every interop session against 2.15,\n2.16 and 2.17.0 servers, including lustre-master's own full runs:\n\"lfs migrate: cannot get group lock: Invalid argument (22)\".  The\ntest needs the lod_ost_alloc_specific() fallback that landed with\nit in v2_17_53-25-gd2aaf9d4c4; an older MDS still rejects the stale\nstripe offset of the uninitialized component.\n\nSkip the test when the MDS predates that change.\n\nFixes: d2aaf9d4c4b8 (\"LU-19519 lod: allow migration of PFL with invalid OST\")\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nTest-Parameters: testlist=sanity-pfl env=ONLY=28\nTest-Parameters: testlist=sanity-pfl serverversion=2.17 env=ONLY=28\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:Opus-5.5 llm_code_and_review_tools\nSigned-off-by: Marc Vef <mvef@whamcloud.com>\nChange-Id: I53a6c6460d34db3967182f9f83df7ef763132c28\n"
      },
